# Changements à appliquer dans cascade/package.json

## 1. SCRIPTS À MODIFIER

```diff
"scripts": {
-  "test": "cross-env NODE_ENV=test jest",
-  "test:watch": "cross-env NODE_ENV=test jest --watch",
-  "test:coverage": "cross-env NODE_ENV=test jest --coverage",
+  "test": "vitest",
+  "test:ui": "vitest --ui",
+  "test:run": "vitest run",
+  "test:coverage": "vitest run --coverage"
}
```

## 2. DÉPENDANCES À AJOUTER

```bash
npm install -D vitest @vitest/coverage-v8
```

```json
"devDependencies": {
  "vitest": "^1.0.0",
  "@vitest/coverage-v8": "^1.0.0"
}
```

## 3. DÉPENDANCES À SUPPRIMER (Optionnel)

```bash
npm uninstall jest @types/jest babel-jest
```

```diff
"devDependencies": {
-  "jest": "^29.0.0",
-  "@types/jest": "^29.0.0",
-  "babel-jest": "^29.0.0"
}
```

## 4. CONFIGURATION COMPLÈTE APRÈS CHANGEMENTS

```json
{
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "nodemon src/server.js",
    "start": "node src/server.js",
    "test": "vitest",
    "test:ui": "vitest --ui",
    "test:run": "vitest run",
    "test:coverage": "vitest run --coverage",
    "lint": "eslint src/",
    "db:setup": "npm run db:clean && node src/scripts/db-simple-init.js",
    "db:clean": "node src/scripts/db-clean.js",
    "db:verify": "node src/scripts/db-verify.js"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "vitest": "^1.0.0",
    "@vitest/coverage-v8": "^1.0.0",
    "nodemon": "^3.0.0",
    "eslint": "^8.0.0"
  }
}
```

## 5. COMMANDES NPM APRÈS MIGRATION

```bash
# Mode watch (auto re-run sur changements)
npm run test

# Run une fois (pour CI)
npm run test:run

# UI graphique interactive
npm run test:ui

# Coverage report
npm run test:coverage
```
